=== guestbook: load example -- cgi-run dispatches handler ===
Status: 200 OK
Connection: close
Content-Length: 423
content-type: text/html; charset=utf-8

<!doctype html>
<html><head><title>Guestbook</title></head><body>
<h1>Guestbook</h1>
<ul>
<li><strong>Bob</strong>: Hello &lt;script&gt;</li>
<li><strong>Alice</strong>: First post</li>
</ul>
<form method="post" action="">
  <p><label>Name: <input name="name" type="text"></label></p>
  <p><label>Message: <textarea name="message"></textarea></label></p>
  <p><button type="submit">Sign</button></p>
</form>
</body></html>
=== guestbook: row inserted by POST handler ===
PASS: two rows after POST
PASS: name stored verbatim
PASS: message stored unescaped
